  "/you-can-see-everything-2026-247346/movie-overview": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n            {\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Movie\",\"name\":\"You Can See Everything (2026)\",\"director\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Nathan Fielder\",\"url\":\"https://www.fandango.com/people/nathan-fielder-763639\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Lance Oppenheim\",\"url\":\"https://www.fandango.com/people/lance-oppenheim-889479\"}],\"duration\":174,\"contentRating\":\"R\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-16\",\"url\":\"https://www.fandango.com/you-can-see-everything-2026-247346/movie-overview\",\"image\":\"https://images.fandango.com/ImageRenderer/0/0/redesign/static/img/default_poster--dark-mode.png/0/images/masterrepository/Fandango/247346/V8_404_DIGITAL%20FINAL_2025x3000_V4.jpg\",\"genre\":\"Documentary\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"name\":\"Audience Score\",\"description\":\"The Audience Score, denoted by a popcorn bucket, is the percentage of users who have rated the movie or TV Show positively. For films to which we can verify users have bought tickets, the Audience Score is made up of Verified Ratings\",\"bestRating\":\"100\",\"worstRating\":\"0\",\"ratingValue\":96,\"ratingCount\":2706},\"description\":\"Thirty-four days before she’s sent to prison, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes YOU CAN SEE EVERYTHING.\"}\n            </script>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"cast-carousel__item splide__slide\"> <a class=\"js-cast-carousel-item cast-carousel__brick\" href=\"/people/nathan-fielder-763639\" data-name=\"Nathan Fielder\" data-id=\"763639\"> <img class=\"cast-carousel__img\" src=\"https://images.fandango.com/ImageRenderer/100/0/redesign/static/img/default_poster.png/0/imag